{"server":"cn","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_03_beg","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_03","title":"油泼扯面","storyCode":"OR-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"bd53d5fb5a1154aae0e02bdea6875c4dbaa7d219983a15289d8e213c9a2a764f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g8_baizaoacademy"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1622_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天课上与老师辩论，获益匪浅。不过关于当今新政的种种问题，我还是坚持自己的观点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1622_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天遗留下的问题，我会继续思考的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百灶学宫讲师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1631_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨，这座学宫的校园够宽敞，足够容下不同的思想和声音。如果我的观点无法说服你，那你就不该因为我讲师的身份而勉强认同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百灶学宫讲师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1631_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身处这座学宫里的学生，当以天下民生为己任，但也要注意，切不可沉湎于想象与空谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1622_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢老师。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"时钟悬挂在古朴楼宇的顶端，日影和时针一并流转。清脆的钟声响起，不一会，熙攘的人群便挤满了校园。\n一个身影逆人流而上，摩肩接踵之间，看守也没有注意到这个陌生面孔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1628_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好......？请问，需要什么帮助吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同学，请问，存放学生档案的档案室怎么走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1628_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是问学籍科？你有什么事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是新来的助教，教授让我去整理一下往届毕业生的档案......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1628_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1628_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哪一位教授？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兵部属学院，讲军事理论的景教授。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她今天满课，所以才派我来帮她处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1628_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1628_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从这里往前走，过了主楼以后右转，丙申号楼就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1628_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......还是快点去吧，千万不能耽误了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g13_yuskitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，任何饭店的第一道规矩——进了这后厨，大厨的话就是绝对的指令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要通过鼎丰楼的厨师选拔，去见那个莫不服，那从现在起，就要老老实实听我的指挥，明白了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们不是约好了，拿到奖金三七分成，怎么你说得跟我欠你人情一样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，别叽叽歪歪了。你不是本来就说想学做几道菜吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？你不乐意去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想去是想去，可我又不是什么罗德岛精英大厨。听名字，这比赛就简单不了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你为什么不自己去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是堂堂“余味居”的掌勺，去参加鼎丰楼举办的比赛，岂不是自降身份......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你一个机会，你就作为我的亲传弟子，去厨艺大赛上一展身手，好好挫一挫那个莫不服的威风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说到做菜，行箸不该比我更合适吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实在抱歉，“行箸散人”这个名字已经为人熟知了，这种场合，我不太好参与其中......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闲话少说，为了让你更了解这个比赛，我还是先介绍一下鼎丰楼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从来到百灶开始好像就一直听到这个名字，这个鼎丰楼到底什么来头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先前和你提起过，百灶有以炎国东西南北四大菜系为特色的“四大名楼”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概四百年前，有几位大厨先后来到百灶挂牌，也算是“开宗立派”，这被视作四大菜系正式成形的标志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"促成这一群英荟萃的局面的，正是当初鼎丰楼的第一代大厨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位传奇大厨的名字已经不可考，相传，他本人虽然是北方菜系的代表人物，但对其余三大菜系也都十分精通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其余三家饭店的厨师呢，都是在厨艺切磋中输给他后才应邀来到百灶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有这样一段往事，鼎丰楼在名声上自然盖过了其他三家，被人们评为四大名楼之首，也算是“百灶第一楼”啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你讲还是我讲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，对不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......不过这个姑娘说的也基本大差不差，百灶四大名楼的确有这么一段往事，只是后面却演变成了争名夺利的戏码，实在是惹人烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来是想让大家交流学习互通有无，结果搞成了门派斗争、谁也不待见谁的局面，早知道我就不去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不去什么？"},{"type":"narration","text":"咳......！\n总之你要知道的是，鼎丰楼作为百灶历史最久、名声最响的饭店，选拔厨师的标准自然也是高得离谱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鼎丰楼已经好多年没有招过厨师学徒了，要不是最近他们遇上了点麻烦，又恰逢百珍宴筹备，急缺人手，才不会破例举办比赛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我也听说，那位莫大厨年事已高，但迟迟没有找到可以接班的学徒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比赛的方式花样很多，每次都有所不同，但唯一不变的是，参赛的厨师要做一道自己最拿手的菜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下等一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们说了这么多，所以像这种等级的比赛，我怎么可能通过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按理说，想要让一个没什么做饭经验的人通过鼎丰楼的厨师测试，听上去是不太靠谱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过既然有我在，我可以教你一道既好学，又一定会在百珍宴上用到的菜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长寿面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长寿面？百珍宴上为什么会吃长寿面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当今真龙的寿辰，恰好就在中秋节这天。所以每年的百珍宴上，都会固定有一道长寿面送给真龙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是一般来说，长寿面都是很家常的做法......真的适合参加这种比赛吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁说家常菜就看不出厨子水平？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就小露一手......看好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么味道......好香！怎么会这么香！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的和变魔术一样，刚才那几样食材放到锅里煮过后，就变成了这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲜壳兽、香菇、葱花、青菜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食材的确都是寻常的食材，烹饪的手法好像也没有什么特殊的......可这香味还真不一般。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灶台上的功夫藏在看不见的地方，就这一碗长寿面，讲究也多着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同样的食材，只要找到那个最精确的配比和火候，做出的味道也可以天差地别——你以为这配方我琢磨了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都别愣着了，尝尝吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我收回对你的评价！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"囫囵吞枣的......你吃出什么名堂了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果煌小姐真的能完全复制出这种味道，说不定就能见到鼎丰楼的那位总厨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是煌小姐......能做到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要琢磨出来这碗面的独门秘方不容易，但只要严格照着配方去做，复现出来总不难吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前下过厨吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在就把这碗面的配方和做法详细地告诉你，你就依葫芦画瓢，总能学会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！我一定用功学习，不会让你失望的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g1_yusrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不是说你会做饭吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"委屈的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"方便面的面条都是现成的，我哪知道面粉是怎么变成面条的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真是——朽木不可雕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"委屈的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你这不还没怎么教吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还让我怎么教？揉个面的工夫都摔我几个碗了？这么大点厨房还不够你搞破坏的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟......哎哟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心点，都小心点......这锅碗瓢盆都不便宜，摔坏了还得买新的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么搜不到？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g9_dalitemple"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顾筌，维多利亚归侨，1074年开始定居炎国，1076年考入百灶学宫，完成学业后入职礼部......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那场案件的死者仅存的一点人事档案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凡是从学宫毕业后进入朝中六部工作的官员，档案都会在学宫留档......但为什么搜不到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顾筌，你到底......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"教授，我也只是和您确认一下，倒也不用麻烦您亲自过来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严厉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个人说她是新来的助教？我怎么没有听说过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是来访的那个人看上去好像对您很熟悉，我就没有怀疑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严厉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说了多少次，学宫的资料多涉及机密，平时一定要有保密意识——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严厉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我自己去确认吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严厉的教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"narration","text":"房间里空无一人，案上的文件陈列依旧，看不出一丝移动过的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严厉的教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严厉的教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"青砚，多大的人了，还要玩捉迷藏吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐......姐姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严厉的教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大理寺少卿这是抓犯人抓到学校来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大理寺查案，想要调取一些过去的资料，还请姐......还请景教授配合一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，既然是大理寺查案，那给我看看公文吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......出门的时候走得急，落在办公室了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗，那我直接打电话给大理寺确认一下总可以吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等......等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"教授？您还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"需不需要......我去叫安保人员？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（求饶的眼神）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，是我忘了，之前的确有委托另一个老师来取点资料的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，麻烦你白跑一趟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没事的教授！教授再见！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，现在只剩你我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢......谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，青砚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向来以为你是个端庄持重的孩子，以前每次和小乐提起你，都让他以你为榜样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你现在这又是在做什么？堂堂大理寺少卿，偷偷摸摸的，像什么话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"调查案件......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么案子见不得光，不能走正常的程序？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一桩旧案......死者曾经是百灶学宫的学生。可是我刚才发现，学宫的档案里竟然完全找不到这个人的信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一个进入学宫的学生都会在这里留下档案，你说的这个人......你是在哪里看到他是学宫的学生的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大理寺留存的档案......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大理寺档案是直接从礼部调取的，但礼部的档案和学宫的却对不上号，总有一边出了错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"学宫的资料，有可能被人改动吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"学宫担负着向大炎治理体系输送人才的重要使命，每一个学生的资料一经归档，都会被严密保管，容不得半点差错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有权限修改这档案资料的，除非是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......还是不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别瞎想了，快走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马上就到饭点了，待会儿来来往往去吃饭的人多，再让别人看到你在这，怕是还要惹上更多麻烦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，下回记得别再做这么荒唐的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃饭......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要回百灶调查，你查这些旅游攻略干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"这都是我爸在写给我的信里提到的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"“守拙园”“明德书局”......还有他上学的时候，学校门口有一家“尚蜀小馆”，那里的回锅肉片味道一绝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"这次去百灶，他提过的地方，我都想去看看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"学宫附近......有没有一家叫“尚蜀小馆”的饭店？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？想吃尚蜀菜了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你说的那家饭店，都关门三十几年了吧......奇怪，你怎么会知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三十几年？你确定吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，想起来了，1065年，那就是我上学时候的事，怎么会记错？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那家“尚蜀小馆”因为离学宫近，价格实惠，很受当时学生们的欢迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那一年尚蜀遭遇了一场天灾，店主人便回老家了。当时学生们还自发捐了款。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一个久居维多利亚的归侨，1074年才第一次来炎国，他怎么会知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非他之前就来过炎国，或者说......他根本不是什么维多利亚归侨，就是炎国人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你嘀咕什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果说......顾筌在礼部的信息有假，而他曾经的确是学宫的学生，那学宫的档案里一定可以查到一些线索......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照煌出生的年纪，再往前推的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个学籍系统中，能查到1052年至1062年之间入学学生的信息吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我一次......这件事真的很重要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"学宫每年毕业的学生数以千计，你还要一口气查十年的资料，你得查到什么时候去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人在礼部任职，在学宫应该也是在礼部下属的学院，这样或许可以缩小一点范围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你要找的那个人不是身居要职的官员，或许可以从1055年之后开始找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一年学宫制度改革，办学宗旨从单一的为行政体系输送人才变成了普及教育，也因此扩招了许多学生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多谢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧吧......你只有一个时辰的时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......顾笙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"男，1037年出生于琅珆，于1055年考入百灶学宫，分入礼部下属的教育科......是学宫改制后第一批入学的学生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在校期间，所有科目成绩全是甲等一级，可是......他没有完成学业？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文件的更新时间是......1062年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这份档案......是失踪人员档案？"},{"type":"narration","text":"“顾笙与其妻女二人，于1062年失踪。以此档封存。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在百灶时就是有家人的......一家三口，全部失踪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"1062年......为什么偏偏是1062年？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，我再确认一遍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是1062年，在维多利亚出生的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，从我记事起，我就是在维多利亚长大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在问你在哪里出生......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那我哪能记得——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顾筌......顾笙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"景教授","speakerId":"avg_npc_1620_1","isRemote":false,"text":"青砚，时间差不多了，该离开了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g13_yuskitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他怎么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，揉出来的面还是不能用。再来一遍吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这已经是第二十遍了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别着急，你练习了一整天，手法和发力问题已经有很大改善了。每一次都在进步，离成功也不远了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实在不好意思，你不用陪我受罪的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也没什么关系啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么上心地帮我，这个答案对行箸来说也非同一般吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！稍等一下，马上我学会了揉面，就好好地下一碗面来给你当晚饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚......你是不是还有什么别的话想对我说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么别的话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没......没什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平心而论，那位小大厨给出来的配方的确已经足够简明，大概他也没有想到，对煌小姐来说，最大的难点，居然是和面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还帮他说话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有什么办法，我就是这样的体质啊......一干活体温就容易升高，面团揉两下就变干了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面多加水水多加面，又是加面又是加水......原本就拳头大小的面团，现在都跟我脑袋差不多大了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐的这种体质，的确少见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过乐观一点，只要学会了和面，这碗长寿面你也就学得八九不离十啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，煌小姐虽然没有怎么做过饭，但刀工意外地还不错呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来在罗德岛的时候——就是我工作的地方，在紧急关头，像我这样的精英干员都是会给自己做点应急手术的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要不像小大厨那样咔嚓咔嚓地切菜，手术刀和菜刀，我感觉用起来也差不太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给自己缝伤口练出来的手艺，都可以自己补衣服了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到......煌小姐的工作竟然这么危险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......谁还不是，从不会到会，慢慢学过来的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越想越气，他就不能，耐心点吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这个力道是对的，保持住！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，到现在，一口晚饭，都还没吃呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保持这种生气的感觉！叠过来继续揉，可以再生气一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，没法再生气了......他做的面确实很好吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没力气了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好累......为什么做饭，比作战训练还要累......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，也确实是难为你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不想理那个小个子了！行箸，我能不能拜你为师？你作为美食家，也一定会教人做饭对不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"饶了我吧......要比做饭的手艺，我和那位小大厨还差着十万八千里呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，说来有些好笑，其实我没有吃过长寿面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"长寿面不也就是碗面？你都吃过那么多餐厅了，怎么可能没吃过长寿面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去过的很多餐厅确实都会有长寿面，不过，长寿面必须要生日的时候吃才有意义吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我都是在家过的生日，生日那天，我必须要在家里待着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但就算是家里过生日，你的爸妈难道都不会给你做长寿面吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，我从来没有见过他们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然没有见过父母，但我还有别的家人，每逢生辰，家里都会为我办非常非常热闹的宴席。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那种场合，长寿面对他们来说大概就有些无关紧要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我也一直有些害怕过生日......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人记挂着你的生日，不是好事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也说不清那是种什么感觉。总觉得，每次一过生日我就会被很多人围起来，他们又要让我笑，又盼着我哭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我在那里或是不在那里，似乎又并不要紧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是别说我啦......说起来，煌小姐是维多利亚人，那里也有吃长寿面的习俗吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在维多利亚长大，但父母都是炎国人——至少在血统上是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小时候每次过生日，我妈都会给我做一碗长寿面。味道也没什么特别的，就是家常菜吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来离开家，吃不到我妈做的饭，自己也都忘了还有过生日这回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到有天晚上......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"调料包，蔬菜包......还能加两根火腿肠，嘿嘿......食堂怎么没开灯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你们在这儿干吗？吓我一跳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘，小点声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，都这么晚了，你们不睡觉，躲在食堂干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......Ace，你怎么一脸严肃地看着我......不会是又有什么紧急任务吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"你手里拿的是什么？泡面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"下午在训练场待了太久，晚饭没吃饱啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，难道当上精英干员就连泡面也不能吃了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的队长不是在责备你又在猛塞垃圾食品，他的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天你过生日欸，难道就吃这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"生日......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"可是凯尔希医生不是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以才让你小声点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要动静别闹太大，我猜就算她听到了，也会装作不知情的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至怀疑，她故意将我们外勤任务的空档调到一起，就是为了给你办一场生日会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就当这也是她给你的生日祝福吧......虽然很难想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，你是我们中的一员，是罗德岛的一员。你不是一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"大家......我，那个，谢谢你们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，现在已经到零点了。生日快乐，煌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大猫，生日快乐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生日快乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生日快乐！还有，阿米娅不在本舰上，她让我替她送上祝福，生日快乐，她希望你永远开心健康。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，你是准备来吹蜡烛切蛋糕，还是继续吃你的泡面？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g13_yuskitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是第一次，有那么多人一起给我过生日。那碗泡面就变成了我的“长寿面”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都知道我多希望能办一次生日会，可那天，没有一个人说“我就知道你很想要这个”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们表现得，就像......这只是无数次生日会中，很普通的一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜欢那种“普通”的感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来，还挺让人羡慕的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了！你说你没有吃过长寿面，那我来给你做一碗长寿面吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你不是连和面都还没有学会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不会和面，但现成的面我还是知道该怎么煮的。我去问问老姜，有没有挂面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......手工面......挂面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定真的可行！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]}]}
